    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone/Extension:</td>
      <td><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>CONTRIBUTION LEVEL</h2>

  <p>The amount indicated below will be deducted from your pay beginning with the next pay period. You can make changes at any time by contacting the Payroll Office. The percentage of your paycheck reduction must be in whole % increments or you can choose the IRS maximum allowable contribution. You will receive separate instructions on how to choose your investment allocations. See our record keeper TIAA-CREF and can also find additional information on plan options at <a href="#">{{ plan_info_url }}</a>.</p>

  <p>Indicate your contribution level(s) below. The College will match the first 4% of employee deferrals.</p>

