  <p>I authorize Augustana College to reduce my pay effective the beginning of the next pay cycle following the date in which this agreement is executed. I understand this agreement is legally binding and changes will require completing additional forms and will become effective with the next pay cycle after the form is received by Augustana Human Resources. If my employment with Augustana ends, contributions will end automatically with my last paycheck.</p>

